pro_course_detail.description:
These customized lessons are suitable for students looking to advance their Business English. We will work on what is relevant to you.

These lessons will help you:
- Understand the critical aspects of Business English (customized to your industry);
- Develop your networking and relationship building skills;
- Structure conversation and Q&A;
- Build a better resume, LinkedIn profile and work on your personal brand;
- Master the art of great presentations including terminology and business idioms;
- Master industry specific vocabulary;
- Get a better understanding of specific concepts such as GAAP, IFRS, SPVs, DTAs, CITs;
- Develop email communication, including strategies for follow up emails;
- Adapt to the etiquette of general business conversations.

As we work through our lessons, you will gain confidence and develop your own style. 

I started my career in investment banking, went on to work for a private equity real estate business and I now work in a family office. I want to share my knowledge with you, as I coach and become your career mentor.

Industries covered: Consulting, Real Estate, Tax, Finance, Design, IT, Investment Banking, Law, Marketing, Oil & Gas, Commodities, Marketing

***Note for any class changes or cancellations, the Italki changes and cancellations policy applies.***
